          %h2#Examples Examples
          %p
            Examples of AQFT
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+nets+of+observables"} local nets of observables
            that encode interacting quantum field theories are not easy to construct. The construction of
            %em free
            field theories is well understood, see the references
