          %h3#ReferencesPerturbationTheory Perturbation theory and renormalization
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/perturbation+theory"} Perturbation theory
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/renormalization"} renormalization
            in the context of AQFT and is discussed in the following articles.
          %p
